2002 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Current ambulance systems are limited by\072\015\n\n\200 Road dependency\015\n\200 Traffic congestion\015\n\200 Delayed hospital communication\015\n\nThis creates an opportunity to rethink emergency transport as a faster\054 adaptive\015\nsystem rather than a single\055mode vehicle\056\015\n\n\042From a single\055mode vehicle to a multimodal emergency system\056\042)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 2003 0 R
     /Pg 1978 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
