2006 0 obj
  << /ActualText (To address the limitations of conventional ambulance systems\054 ECO \050Emergency Care Orbit\051 is proposed as\015\na multimodal emergency transport solution\056\015\n\nECO is a dual\055mode ambulance that seamlessly integrates\072\015\n\200 Road mobility for accessibility in dense urban areas\015\n\200 Elevated electromagnetic transport for high\055speed\054 traffic\055free movement\015\n\nThis system allows ambulances to operate like traditional vehicles when needed\054 while also accessing a dedicated elevated network to bypass congestion and significantly\015reduce response time\056\n\015\nBy combining flexibility with speed\054 ECO transforms emergency transport into a faster\054 adaptive\054 and more\015\nefficient system designed for modern cities\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 2007 0 R
     /Pg 1978 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

