2018 0 obj
  << /ActualText (ECO operates as a hybrid ambulance system that seamlessly switches between two modes depending on road conditions\056\n\015\nIn Ground Mode\054 the ambulance functions like a conventional vehicle\054 navigating through city streets to reach patients in dense or inaccessible areas\056\015\n\nWhen faced with heavy traffic or long\055distance routes\054 it transitions into Elevated Mode\054 where it connects to an electromagnetic track positioned below metro infrastructure\056 This allows the ambulance to bypass congestion and travel at high speed without interruptions\056\015\n\nThe system follows a three\055step journey\072\015\n1\056 Access \204 Reaches the patient via road networks\015\n2\056 Transition \204 Attaches and lifts onto the elevated track\015\n3\056 Transport \204 Moves rapidly to the hospital\015\n\nBy combining flexibility and speed\054 ECO ensures efficient emergency response across varying urban conditions\056)
     /K [ 20 ]
     /P 2019 0 R
     /Pg 1978 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

