  << /ActualText (Research findings revealed a strong awareness of traffic\055related delays and a high demand for faster\054 more efficient emergency systems\056 At the same \ntime\054 respondents expressed concerns regarding safety\054 cost\054 and maintenance\054 indicating a need for solutions that are not only innovative but also \nreliable and feasible\056 Overall\054 the response highlights both the need and acceptance of innovation in emergency medical services\054 while emphasising \nthe importance of addressing practical challenges for successful implementation\056)
